k19 ported node path.resolve/normalize/dirname (Lib node_path_*) from node lib/path.js posix only (ADR 0018). Node on win32 uses path.win32 (drive letters, backslashes, UNC), so FileSystemLoader search paths, the containment guard and Loader resolve would differ from node on Windows. The oracle runs on Linux, so this is not measurable here today; needs a win32 port of the same functions keyed on $^O, or a recorded divergence in ADR 0018.

